        "summary": "查询支持的云服务列表",
        "description": "查询支持的云服务列表。\ncurl调用示例:\n```\ncurl -i -k -H 'Accept:application/json' -H \"X-Auth-Token:xxxxx\" -H 'Content-Type:application/json;charset=utf8' -X GET  https://accessip:port/rest/order/v3.0/orders/sa-fb-1/services\n```",
        "x-precautions": "1.header中需要携带操作用户的可用token,key值为:x-auth-token。\n2.错误码:当请求不成功时,响应体内的错误码信息请参见“ManageOne 运营面API参考 > 错误码说明 > 订单管理”章节。\n",
        "x-opseverity": "Minor",
        "tags": [
          "订单管理"
        ],
        "x-resource": "订单管理",
        "operationId": "ListRegionServices",
        "produces": [
          "application/json"
        ],
        "consumes": [
          "application/json"
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "x-language",
            "in": "header",
            "type": "string",
            "description": "语言类型:中文zh-cn、英文en-us。"
          },
          {
            "name": "x-auth-token",
            "in": "header",
            "required": true,
            "type": "string",
            "description": "操作用户的token。"
          },
          {
            "name": "region_id",
            "in": "path",
            "description": "Region ID,最大长度36。。",
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 36,
            "required": true
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "查询支持的service列表成功。",
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/ServiceList"
            },
            "examples": {
              "application/json": {
                "services": [
                  {
                    "service_id": "evs",
                    "service_name": "Elastic Volume Service"
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "参数错误。"
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "token鉴权失败。"
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "URL鉴权。"
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "rest接口没找到。"
          },
          "406": {
            "description": "流控限流。"
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "默认ServiceException异常码,应用内部错误。"
          }
        },
        "x-support-sdk": "N",
        "x-request-examples-url-1": "GET https://{endpoint}/rest/order/v3.0/orders/region-az1/services",
